// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`agent context views > builds the per-turn map view with the current level 1`] = `
"## Current plan
Project: Career Manager

Features (flow id = feature id):
- career-profile: Career profile and job overview (no flows yet)
- job-search: Job search and tailored applications (4/18 done)
  - flow tailor-cv-flow: Tailor CV (under node tailor-cv; 2/10 done)
    - flow pick-template-flow: Pick CV template (under node pick-template; 1/4 done)
  - flow form-help-flow: Answer application-form questions (under node form-help; 0/3 done)
- application-tracker: Application tracker (no flows yet)
- interview-prep: Interview prep (no flows yet)
- career-growth: Achievements and promotion prep (no flows yet)
- email-integration: Email integration (1/11 done)
  - flow connect-flow: Connect email account (under node connect-account; 1/4 done)
  - flow classify-flow: Classify email (under node email-classifier; 0/4 done)

Shared components (use a reference node to include one in a flow):
- app-database: App database (database, PostgreSQL)
- llm-api: LLM API (external-api, Claude API)

Connections between features:
- career-profile -> job-search [data: experiences, skills, goals]
- job-search -> application-tracker [data: application record (job, CV version, cover letter)]
- email-integration -> application-tracker [data: status update from email]
- career-profile -> interview-prep [data: experiences for STAR stories]
- application-tracker -> interview-prep [data: interview scheduled]
- application-tracker -> career-growth [data: offer accepted]
- career-growth -> career-profile [data: new achievements]
- job-search -> llm-api [data: job description + profile]

## Flow the user is viewing
Flow tailor-cv-flow: Tailor CV (2/10 done)
Path: Overview › Job search and tailored applications › Tailor CV
File: plan/features/job-search.yaml

Nodes:
- parse-job: "Extract requirements from the job description" (step, status=done)
- match-profile: "Match profile experiences to requirements" (step, status=in_progress)
- pick-template: "Pick CV template" (step, expands=pick-template-flow (1/4 done))
- generate-cv: "Generate tailored CV" (step)
- cv-llm: "LLM API" (reference, ref=llm-api)
- review-cv: "Review and edit CV" (step)
- export-cv: "Export PDF and Word" (step)
- cv-versions: "CV versions" (component, kind=storage, tech=Local files)

Edges:
- parse-job -> match-profile [data: requirements list]
- match-profile -> pick-template
- pick-template -> generate-cv [data: template + matched experiences]
- generate-cv -> cv-llm [data: prompt with job and profile]
- cv-llm -> review-cv [data: draft CV]
- review-cv -> export-cv
- export-cv -> cv-versions [data: CV file + version]

Current level: Overview › Job search and tailored applications › Tailor CV"
`;

